// Intrinsics of std/time on the native backends (decision 0094): the
// one symbol the build defines beside a program that uses std/time, in
// the zone data it writes (compiler/xo tz.xo tz_source, ld.xo
// tz_object). Imported by std/native/llrt/tzhost.xo, which finds the zone
// data and keeps the zones parsed so far in Xo (work item B27; they were
// std/llrt/xo_time.c).

/// The address of the program's zone data table: four words, the mode (0
/// the TZif data of each constant zone name, 1 the whole zoneinfo.zip, 2
/// the host's database), the address of the zip and its length, and the
/// address of the blobs (three words each: the name as a C string, the
/// data, its length; ended by a zero name).
fn tz_table() -> Int
